  "ruleText": "He-W 536.02 Recipient Eligibility. All recipients shall be eligible for services delivered by a medical services clinic in accordance with He-W 536.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #6133, eff 11-30-95; ss by #7825, eff 2-8-03; ss by #9860, eff 2-8-11, EXPIRED: 2-8-19\n\nNew. #12732, INTERIM, eff 2-22-19, EXPIRED: 8-21-19\n\nNew. #12877, eff 9-25-19",
